As an SRE/DevOps engineer, consider these points:
Area	What to check
Docker network	Both containers must be connected to the same network.
Container name	Use the correct container name or network alias as hostname.
Port	Ensure the destination application is listening on the correct port.
Firewall	Check host firewall and network restrictions.
Application config	Verify hostname, port, username and password.
Container health	Check whether both containers are running and healthy.
Logs	Check application and database logs.
Security	Avoid hardcoding passwords in Dockerfiles or source code.
Persistence	Use Docker volumes for database data.
Dependencies	Ensure the database is ready before the application starts connecting.
